<div class="wb-check-form">
  <p><strong>{{remaining}} / {{max}}</strong> hit-die uses available · {{die}} {{modifier}} VIT per use.</p>
  <label>Dice to spend
    <input type="number" name="count" value="1" min="1" max="{{remaining}}" step="1" autofocus>
  </label>
  <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>Short-rest rules</summary>
    <p>Each use rolls your current hit die plus your VIT modifier. Uses equal your level and refill on a long rest. Healing stops at your maximum Health. Each selected use is spent, including rolls that heal 0.</p>
  </details>
</div>
